sequenceDiagram
    participant Server as build SSR
    participant HTML as static HTML
    participant React as React client
    participant DOM as browser DOM
    participant RAF as ResizeObserver

    Server ->> HTML: render with tileCount = 0
    HTML -->> React: hydrateRoot
    React ->> DOM: match server output (zero squares)
    React ->> React: useEffect runs after paint
    React ->> DOM: read parent.scrollHeight
    React ->> React: setTileCount(N)
    React ->> DOM: re-render with N tiles
    DOM ->> RAF: layout settles
    Note over RAF: page may grow as MDX images decode
    RAF -->> React: ResizeObserver fires
    React ->> React: recompute tileCount
    React ->> DOM: add tiles if needed
